# Everything this repository produces runs on Linux: the containers, the CI
# runners, the cluster. So text files are stored AND checked out with LF, on
# every platform, rather than letting core.autocrlf hand a Windows clone CRLF
# copies.
#
# This is not cosmetic. With CRLF:
#   - localstack-init/init-aws.sh breaks inside the container ("bad
#     interpreter": the shebang line ends in \r),
#   - the pre-commit trailing-whitespace/end-of-file-fixer hooks rewrite
#     files on every commit, producing a diff that never converges.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats: never touch these.
*.docx binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.joblib binary
